# Architecture

- `declare(strict_types=1);` on every PHP file.
- Bootstrap via `includes/bootstrap.php` only — do not open extra PDO connections.
- Settings: `setting()` / `setting_set()`; add defaults in `setting_defaults()`.
- Multi-step writes use a transaction. Slug conflicts: retry with numeric suffix.
- CSS: tokens in `assets/css/tokens.css`, not one-off hex per page.

```php
// BAD
$site = 'My Blog';
// GOOD
$site = setting('site_name');
```
